CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* const E prvalue binds const E&: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* E prvalue binds E&&: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* const call result binds const E&: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] .* aggregate braced prvalue binds E&&: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] .* call prvalue binds E&&: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.6\] .* lvalue binds const E&: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.7\] .* class prvalues bind C&&: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.8\] .* class lvalue binds const C&: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.9\] .* WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
g++ 13 (-fsanitize=address,undefined) and clang++ 18 accept this program,
and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
